WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.336
Riding a bus route for the first time. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:06.336 --> 00:00:12.816
Before we go, we check the route in a timetable app: the stop and the time.

3
00:00:12.816 --> 00:00:16.968
We arrive at our stop A a few minutes early.

4
00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:21.984
We get on and tap our card, same as any ride.

5
00:00:21.984 --> 00:00:27.264
We count the stops, or follow the dot on the map in the app.

6
00:00:27.264 --> 00:00:32.592
We get off one stop before the big junction, as planned.

7
00:00:32.592 --> 00:00:39.432
If we miss it, we do not panic: we get off at the next stop and cross back.

8
00:00:39.432 --> 00:00:44.304
The second time, the route already feels familiar.

9
00:00:44.304 --> 00:00:52.512
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

